{"id": "DehD9PUoqIN", "title": "Video by adilet.fndr", "description": "If you’ve vibe-coded an app, this one’s for you 🧾\n\nThat photo on your landing page that came from Google Images? US copyright damages run from $750 to $30,000 per image, and up to $150,000 if a court calls it willful. Image-tracking companies scan the web for exactly this and send demand letters.\n\nThat trending song in your launch video? Platform music libraries are licensed for personal posts, not brand ads. Sony sued Marriott over 931 songs in its social posts, with up to nearly $140 million in potential damages.\n\nAnd that “as seen in” strip with logos of publications that never wrote about you is deceptive advertising.\n\nCopying it was free. Keeping it won’t be.\n\nComment PROMPT and I’ll send you the prompt that makes Claude find and fix all of it in your code, plus what you still need to do yourself.\n\nNot legal advice. Talk to a lawyer if money’s on the line.\n\n#vibecoding #startup #founders #claudecode #saas", "channel": "adilet.fndr", "uploader_id": "26455618998", "uploader": "Adilet", "timestamp": 1792070839, "like_count": 162, "comment_count": 82, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/147.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2836839820031806a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.58, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdac140-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMIk_aWGxpzAE2VREU624TJ8R7FgZy9r8EXt_pYrbjbe9NNMpW6YqDrpaWfzLV2a_cKu-ACjQi2H1CWSCGmPstlYNyORaRvulPwl7w.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqnXq3VlPRB6r4aPdQaO4r03to1i09bOiteKxP6ghfDeFfP86Xw5Iar9br6vlWQDP8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdac140-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=9